{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lizard Brain is an atmospheric, arcade game that tests the limits of your memory and puzzle solving skills.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must navigate a series of lethal mazes by committing the correct path to memory before the deadly traps become invisible, forcing you to rely on nothing but your wits.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996950/extras/d16c6afdb01b4da44b196d7de2996b02.poster.avif?t=1766148237\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996950/extras/d16c6afdb01b4da44b196d7de2996b02.webm?t=1766148237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996950/extras/d16c6afdb01b4da44b196d7de2996b02.mp4?t=1766148237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each successful run, you get to choose from a variety of challenges and modifiers, each designed to increase the difficulty and dramatically alter the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996950/extras/1048d5a5957119eded5c39a92fd4cad5.poster.avif?t=1766148237\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996950/extras/1048d5a5957119eded5c39a92fd4cad5.webm?t=1766148237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996950/extras/1048d5a5957119eded5c39a92fd4cad5.mp4?t=1766148237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Choose between challenges that add extra traps, change the maze's orientation, or limit your time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Choices</strong> \u2013 Decide if you want to push your memory with mind bending puzzles or test your reflexes with fast paced runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Experience</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a chilled soundtrack that sets the perfect mood for a memory bending journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on your instincts, and see if you have what it takes to survive the maze and overcome the ultimate mental challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to be quick, because if you're too slow, it'll be a reptile dysfunction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996950/extras/180be7ceeb800b1df132a47d11a167b9.poster.avif?t=1766148237\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996950/extras/180be7ceeb800b1df132a47d11a167b9.webm?t=1766148237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996950/extras/180be7ceeb800b1df132a47d11a167b9.mp4?t=1766148237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Glutton for Punishment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3996950/c61e1d03d0a16e6c0a9882b5f5323cfa275aab8b.jpg"},{"name":"Catch 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3996950/55e3b14d69b05f48c690a7d8e355139d50094955.jpg"},{"name":"Catch 20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3996950/0d5eeab8f10adb69e4a4817d483c281151018362.jpg"},{"name":"Life Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/s